5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find the werewolf! Do you think they're hiding right in front of us? Hehe!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"Let's maintain our composure. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we use today to observe everyone's speaking patterns and reactions.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Minako. A rational approach is best. I will be observing the subtle shifts in everyone's demeanor.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,I'm ready! I'll protect everyone and make sure we catch the wolf. Let's just be honest and get this over with!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I'll follow the group's lead. I think staying calm and listening is the most effective way to start.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, you're so brave! But what if the wolf is pretending to be brave too? That would be a super cool twist!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"@Sakura, while curiosity is good, we must be careful not to let excitement cloud our judgment. Does anyone have a specific strategy?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,I believe we should watch for those who are overly eager to deflect suspicion or those who mirror others too perfectly.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Mirroring? I don't know about that, but I'll just be myself! If anyone acts weird, I'll call them out immediately!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Victoria, that's a valid point. The Possessed might try to blend in by agreeing with the most logical person.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Ooh, the Possessed! This is getting complicated! I'm going to use my super-detective skills to spot them! Hehe!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,It is important to remember that the Seer will have their first result tomorrow. We should be mindful of how that information is shared.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,Indeed. The Seer must be strategic about when to reveal themselves to avoid becoming an immediate target.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'll help protect the Seer! Once they tell us who the wolf is, I'll make sure we get them!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Takumi, we should be careful. If the Seer reveals themselves too early, the wolf wins more easily.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
