40,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"A direct claim on day one is risky for a Seer, but it provides us with a clear target immediately.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Sakura,,Eh?! Me?! That's not true! Minako is lying! I'm just a little girl! Why would you say that? Waaa!,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
