48,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"The logic is simple: if Minako is the Seer, Sakura dies and we win. If Minako is the wolf, we lose a villager.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
